Where it came from
------------------

makeip 2.0.1 (2026-01-20), as carried by KallistiOS under utils/makeip/:

    https://github.com/KallistiOS/KallistiOS/tree/master/utils/makeip

No revision hash is recorded, unlike ../libedc/ and ../libisofs/, because this
was never a vendoring step: the code entered mkdcdisc directly, in commits
c75fb6d (the CRC) and 6ea6ae9 (the PNG-to-MR conversion), both on 2026-08-02,
and only moved here afterwards. There is no upstream drop to resynchronise
against, and no local patch queue against one.

